'''Baboon Shamans''' are a monster encountered in the [[Path of Apmeken]] within the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They are able to summon [[Baboon Thrall]]s, as well as use a magic attack that drains [[prayer points]] equal to the amount of damage dealt.

Each shaman has a maximum amount of thralls it can have summoned at once. If this limit is reached, or are inflicted with [[poison]]/[[venom]], the shaman will switch to using magic attacks instead.

